{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598830/extras/ae69e182dab5a8676b6f1cd476279179.poster.avif?t=1754938108\" width=1600 height=559 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598830/extras/ae69e182dab5a8676b6f1cd476279179.webm?t=1754938108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>You are unemployed. You have a garage in which you start your new business - advertising outsourcing. Look for clients, run advertising campaigns and make money. You will have to pump up your studio, replenishing it with new equipment and techniques. Earn fame and open your way to the leading brands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tough road to the big leagues</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start at the bottom</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one knows you. You'll have to work hard to get potential clients interested. You may even have to work at a loss. Learn to choose the right cameras, light and angles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get on your feet</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With experience comes money. Clients willingly go to an original and ambitious advertiser who knows his business. Invest the first serious earnings in the development of your studio. Carefully choose models, because they are the main thing in the frame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attention, glitter!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A good advertising campaign sells itself, but it is still worth taking the time to actively promote it to get great coverage. More coverage means more people know about you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.ste